-- 11(12): Representative Offence Facts: failed s 11(1), failed 11(7) notice, failed 11(9) notice.
#ASSERT `the registrant is guilty of an offence under section 11(12)` (`Representative Offence Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the registrant is guilty of an offence under section 11(12)` (`Representative Offence Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE)
